{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "" : {},
    "A lighter week means about a third fewer sets at the same weights. Training guidance, not medical advice." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻松一周指重量不变、组数减少约三分之一。仅为训练建议，不构成医疗建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ a month, billed yearly" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "折合每月 %@，按年付费"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ a month, charged to your Apple Account when you confirm. The subscription renews every month at the same price unless you turn it off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it in Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每月 %@，确认购买时从你的 Apple 账户扣款。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时关闭自动续订，订阅会每月以相同价格自动续订。可在“设置 › Apple 账户 › 订阅”中管理或取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ a year, charged to your Apple Account when you confirm. The subscription renews every year at the same price unless you turn it off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it in Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions." : {
