    "Free for %lld days, then %@ a month. Payment is charged to your Apple Account when the trial ends. The subscription renews every month at the same price unless you turn it off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it in Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "免费试用 %1$lld 天，之后每月 %2$@。试用结束时从你的 Apple 账户扣款。除非在当前周期结束前至少 24 小时关闭自动续订，订阅会每月以相同价格自动续订。可在“设置 › Apple 账户 › 订阅”中管理或取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free for %lld days, then %@ a year. Payment is charged to your Apple Account when the trial ends. The subscription renews every year at the same price unless you turn it off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel it in Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions." : {
