      }
    },
    "To suggest your next weights and reps and write your weekly summary, IronSage sends this to Anthropic, the company that makes the Claude AI model:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了建议你下次的重量和次数并撰写每周总结，IronSage 会把以下数据发给 Anthropic（Claude AI 模型背后的公司）："
