            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的训练和你填写的体重会保存到 Apple 健康。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your health data is kept in your IronSage account and is never used for ads. You can change what IronSage may read at any time in the Health settings on your iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
